   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Titanic Dataset — Exploratory Data Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "## Objective\n",
    "This analysis explores the Titanic passenger dataset to understand \n",
    "what factors influenced survival. Key questions:\n",
    "- Did passenger class affect survival chances?\n",
    "- What role did age and sex play?\n",
    "- Was fare a proxy for survival advantage?\n",
    "- How did family size relate to survival?\n",
    "\n",
    "**Dataset:** 891 passengers, 12 features\n",
    "**Source:** Kaggle Titanic Competition"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "9d1476ef",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import seaborn as sns\n",
    "\n",
    "# Display settings\n",
    "pd.set_option(\"display.max_columns\", None)\n",
    "sns.set_style(\"whitegrid\")\n",
    "plt.rcParams[\"figure.dpi\"] = 120\n",
    "plt.rcParams[\"font.size\"] = 11\n",
    "\n",
    "url = \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/datasciencedojo/datasets/master/titanic.csv\"\n",
    "df = pd.read_csv(url)\n",
    "print(f\"Dataset loaded: {df.shape[0]} rows, {df.shape[1]} columns\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "225fee0c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Step 2 — Data overview"
   ]
  },
  {
